  "quality_boundary": "The Sendai review separates the 2021-2030 basic plan, 2024-2026 implementation plan, survey methodology, municipality self-evaluation, enacted initial budget, and settlement values into distinct evidence roles. Six of the 108 challenge projects are now reviewed at core identity/evaluation depth with one-to-one evidence. Their ratings remain Sendai's source-reported self-evaluations and are not converted into an independent achievement score. The other 102 projects remain unreviewed. Fiscal revenue and expenditure remain separate, and budget state is not collapsed into settlement state.",
